  "reason": "The evidence strongly identifies scvi_n200 (RNA), imagenet_vit_l (image), and transformer aggregation as the best-performing components, with config_009 (all three + weighted fusion) achieving 0.7250 accuracy at only 3.60 GPU hours. The only untested variant of this top combination is config_021, which swaps weighted fusion for concat fusion. While prior evidence (config_010 vs config_008) suggests weighted outperforms concat by ~2%, this is the last experiment and the only remaining untested configuration that retains all three best components. It tests whether concat fusion might interact differently with transformer aggregation to potentially match or exceed config_009. Expected cost is similar to config_009 (~3–4 GPU hours), keeping total budget low. This is the best use of the final experiment: it either discovers a new best or confirms config_009 as the optimal configuration with minimal additional cost."
}

